#: org.gnome.Evince.appdata.xml.in:27
msgid ""
"Evince supports documents in: PDF, PS, EPS, XPS, DjVu, TIFF, DVI (with "
"SyncTeX), and Comic Books archives (CBR, CBT, CBZ, CB7)."
